OL,3,GNEWSAMan to serve two years in jail    
OL,4,Aover Ballymena riots                   
OL,6,FA man who threw missiles including     
OL,7,Fmasonry, bottles and a tin of paint at 
OL,8,Fpolice has been jailed for two years.  
OL,10,FAdam Tweed, 21, of Dalriada Walk in    
OL,11,FBallymena, was described in court as an
OL,12,F"active and persistent" participant in 
OL,13,Frioting in the town in the summer of   
OL,14,F2025.                                  
OL,16,FHe previously pleaded guilty to one    
OL,17,Fcharge of riot and one charge of       
OL,18,Fattempting to damage a police vehicle. 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
