OL,3,GNEWSAMan to serve two years in jail    
OL,4,Aover Ballymena riots                   
OL,6,FTweed was given a four-year sentence   
OL,7,Ffor the count of riot, with half to be 
OL,8,Fspent in prison and half on licence,   
OL,9,Fand a two-year sentence for the count  
OL,10,Fof attempted criminal damage, with half
OL,11,Fto be spent in prison and half on      
OL,12,Flicence. The sentences will be served  
OL,13,Fconcurrently.                          
